# The repository stores text with LF, and so should a working copy of it.
#
# Without this, git rewrites files with CRLF on checkout wherever core.autocrlf is on, and
# then Prettier, ESLint and the page generator all report as broken what is only a line
# ending — the whole tree at once, after any merge.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text, whatever a heuristic may think of the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.wav binary
